final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_bq0ks")
blurb = "The Hōsōgami (\"smallpox demon\"), a yōkai thought to cause smallpox. Since people in the past had no effective treatment for smallpox, they tried to appease the demon by assuaging its anger or attacking it.

In Ryūkyū (present-day Okinawa), there was poetry for appeasing the smallpox demon, including a collection of 105 poems published in 1805.

Traditional smallpox-appeasing folk dances have also been observed even in present-day Japan, notably in Ibaraki and Kagoshima prefectures."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
